<p>Some ODS components require javascript to enable user interaction. Each interactive component is available as a CommonJS module. The build package also contains a main file that includes and initializes all modules with their default config.</p>
<h2 class="bold" id="main-file"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="modules#main-file">Main file</a></h2>
<p>Include <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">build/static.js</span></span></code></span> at the bottom of your page, just before the closing <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">body</span></span></code></span> tag.</p>
